  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "问你一下，\n你最推宝可梦的哪一种属性？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "95EE4F604E004E0BFF0C000A4F60670063A85B9D53EF68A6768454EA4E0079CD5C5E6027FF1F00100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我肯定是妖精属性！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621180AF5B9A662F59967CBE5C5E6027FF0100100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的服装是由专精妖精属性的\n著名训练家所设计的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62117684670D88C5662F75314E137CBE59967CBE5C5E60277684000A8457540D8BAD7EC35BB662408BBE8BA17684FF0100100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我和她品味合得来，\n所以理所当然地我也是个妖精推！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211548C597954C1547354085F976765FF0C000A62404EE5740662405F537136573062114E5F662F4E2A59967CBE63A8FF0100100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对了！你和我推的属性，\n在对战中哪个会更强呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF94E86FF014F60548C621163A876845C5E6027FF0C000A57285BF962184E2D54EA4E2A4F1A66F45F3A5462FF1F00100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果想较量我们推的属性哪个更强，\n就来跟我说一声吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C60F38F8391CF62114EEC63A876845C5E602754EA4E2A66F45F3AFF0C000A5C3167658DDF62118BF44E0058F05427300200100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我推妖精属性！\n来和我推的宝可梦们一决胜负吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621163A859967CBE5C5E6027FF01000A6765548C621163A876845B9D53EF68A64EEC4E0051B380DC8D1F5427FF0100100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "来对战吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67655BF962185427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我要准备一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211898151C659074E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "用你推的属性好好做准备吧。\n有多种属性当然也是没问题的哦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75284F6063A876845C5E6027597D597D505A51C6590754273002000A6709591A79CD5C5E60275F5371364E5F662F6CA195EE9898768454E6FF0100100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "马上开始吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9A6C4E0A5F0059CB5427FF0100100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在妖精属性面前，\n某种属性的攻击会没有效果哦。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n你知不知道呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "572859967CBE5C5E60279762524DFF0C000A67D079CD5C5E60277684653B51FB4F1A6CA167096548679C54E6300200100001BE00000A4F6077E54E0D77E590535462FF1F00100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "唉……真遗憾。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "550920262026771F905761BE300200100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在妖精属性的宝可梦面前，\n龙属性的攻击会完全没有效果，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n它们都是很厉害的孩子才对……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "572859967CBE5C5E602776845B9D53EF68A69762524DFF0C000A9F995C5E60277684653B51FB4F1A5B8C51686CA167096548679CFF0C00100001BE00000A5B834EEC90FD662F5F8853895BB376845B695B50624D5BF92026202600100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……不过，它们当然也有\n不擅长对付的属性就是了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "202620264E0D8FC7FF0C5B834EEC5F5371364E5F6709000A4E0D64C5957F5BF94ED876845C5E60275C31662F4E86300200100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果固定使用相同的属性，\n不擅长对付的属性也会变得单一。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C56FA5B9A4F7F752876F8540C76845C5E6027FF0C000A4E0D64C5957F5BF94ED876845C5E60274E5F4F1A53D85F9753554E00300200100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但就算是这样我也会继续推！\n所谓属性推，就是这么一回事！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F465C317B97662F8FD9683762114E5F4F1A7EE77EED63A8FF01000A62408C135C5E602763A8FF0C5C31662F8FD94E484E0056DE4E8BFF0100100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就算不擅长对付的属性变得单一也继续推！\n所谓属性推，就是这么一回事！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
